The bare m003 Riley variety (relator only) has 3 irreducible
components. All THREE recurrent atlas collisions (A~ABBB, AB~ABB,
AAb~AABB) vanish IDENTICALLY on exactly one of them -- the
positive-dimensional geometric/canonical component -- and nowhere
